{"id":"word:hebrew:H5002","type":"word","title":"נְאֻם","subtitle":"H5002 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"an oracle","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to נְאֻם (H5002) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 376 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"נְאֻם (nᵉʼum) means an oracle First listed occurrence: 1Sam 2 30."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"נְאֻם","transliteration":"nᵉʼum","pronunciation":"neh-oom'","strong":"H5002","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5002","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["נְאֻם","נְאֻ֖ם","נְאֻם֙","נְאֻ֣ם","נְאֻ֤ם"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc",372],["HC/Ncmsc",3],["HNcmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"an oracle","usage":"(hath) said, saith.","full":"H5002. neum נְאֻם 376 noun masculine utterance (Ba NB 82 e Kö Lgb ii. 501 &gt; older explanation as Passive participle ); — ׳נ always thus, as construct: — 1 utterance, declaration, revelation , of prophet in ecstatic state ׳נ בלעם Num 24:3 , 15 ; ׳נ אֵל אִמְרֵי שֹׁמֵעַ 24:4 ; 24:6 ; ׳נ הַגֶּבֶר 24:3 ; 24:15 ; 2Sam 23:1 ; Prov 30:1 ; ׳נ דוד 2Sam 23:1 ; ׳נ מֶּשַׁע Psa 36:2 (transgression personified, speaking with prophetic voice לִבּוֺ בְּקֶרֶב ); elsewhere always 2 before divine names (except Jer 23:31 see verb ): ׳נ יהוה utterance, declaration of ׳י (prophet citing divine word given through him), Gen 22:16 (J), Num 14:28 (P), 2Kin 9:26 (twice in verse); 19:33 = Isa 37:34 ; 2Kin 22:19 2Chr 34:27 ; Isa 14:22 ; 30:1 ; 31:9 ; Ezek 13:6-7 , 16:58 ; 37:14 ; Hosea 2:15 ; 2:18 ; 2:23 ; 11:11 ; Joel 2:12 ; Obadiah 4, 8; Micah 4:6 ; 5:9 ; Zeph 1:2-3 , 10 ; 3:8 ; Zech 8:17 ; 10:12 ; 11:6 ; 12:1 , 4 ; 13:8 ; Mal 1:2 + Isa 2 12t.; Jeremiah 162 t.; Amos 14 t.; Haggai 5 t.; Zech 1 (Zechariah 1-8) 6 t.; followed by ישׂראל אלהי 1Sam 2:30 ; Isa 17:6 ; (הַ)צְבָאוֺת ׳י אֱלֹהֵי Amos 6:8 , 14 ; ׳נ ׳י צְבָאוֺת Isa 14:22-23 , 17:3 ; 22:25 ; Jer 8:3 ; 25:29 ; 30:8 ; 49:26 ; Nahum 2:14; Nahum 3:5 ; Zech 13:2 , 7 + Haggai 5 t.; Zech 1 (Zechariah 1-8) 7 t.; followed by ישׂראל אלהי Zeph 2:9 ; י ׳האדון ׳צ Isa 1:24 ; 19:4 ; י ׳אֲדֹנָי הַצּ ׳אֶלֹהֵי Amos 3:13 ; י ׳אדני ׳צ Isa 3:15 ; Jer 49:5 ; י ׳הַמֶּלֶךְ ׳צ 46:18 ; 48:15 ; Jer 57:57; ׳נ יהוה אדני Isa 56:8 ; Jer 2:22 ; Amos 4:5 ; 8:3 , 9 , 11 + Ezekiel 82 t. נְאֻם begins sentence only Isa 56:8 ; Psa 110:1 ; often in middle Isa 49:18 ; Amos 3:10 +; most frequently at end Isa 54:17 ; Amos 2:11 ; 4:3 +; found in all prophets except Habakkuk, Jonah; not in H D of Hexateuch, Chronicles (except || Kings), Daniel, Job or the five Megilloth.","rootNote":"from 5001 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 2 30","keyReferences":["1Sam 2 30","1Sam 2 30","2Chr 34 27","2Kgs 9 26","2Kgs 9 26","2Kgs 19 33","2Kgs 22 19","2Sam 23 1"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":376,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 2 30","book":"1Sam","chapter":2,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 2 30","book":"1Sam","chapter":2,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 34 27","book":"2Chr","chapter":34,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 26","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 26","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 19 33","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 22 19","book":"2Kgs","chapter":22,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Sam 23 1","book":"2Sam","chapter":23,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְאֻ֧ם"